  "duration_s": 392.973991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "爸爸，为什么同样一瓶矿泉水超市卖两块钱，高铁上却卖的更贵？高铁上的东西本来就贵，有什么好奇怪的，可明明是同样的水，为什么换个地方就涨价了？人家卖多少钱，你不买不就行了吗？咱们自己带水就好了。爸爸，那我问你，如果高铁上有好几家卖水的价格还会这么贵吗？那肯定要看他们怎么定价了。对呀，如果买水不方便，选择又少，商家就可能卖的贵一些。不过还要算运输经营这些成本哟。你小子什么时候开始研究做生意了？我知道的可不止这些。爸爸，你有没有发现，很多商场一楼都是化妆品和珠宝，吃饭，看电影却要去楼上，可能是楼上环境好，吃饭舒服呗。那为什么不把餐厅放一楼，大家进来就能吃，不是更方便吗？商场人家自己设计的哪有那么多，为什么爸爸，你看大家进商场是不是都要经过一楼？那当然了，那如果一楼放的是容易吸引人注意的商品，就算本来没打算买的人，路过的时候也可能进去看看。那餐厅为什么要放楼上呢？因为很多人本来就是来吃饭看电影的，把这些店放在楼上，就能让人往上走。经过更多店铺这么说，商场连顾客怎么走都要考虑。当然啦，做生意不光要看卖什么，还要看东西摆在哪里。儿子刚才都是你在问我，现在爸爸考你一个问题。好啊，你说这自助餐交一次钱就能随便吃，万一客人都拼命吃，老板不是要亏本了吗？对呀，有些人一顿能吃好多呢，可是爸爸你觉得每个人都能把一百块钱的东西吃回本吗？那肯定不能。所以老板看的不是某一个人吃了多少，而是所有客人加起来平均能吃掉多少成本。你的意思是有人吃的多，也有人吃的少。对，而且老板还要算食材，人工、房租这些成本，只要整体收入能盖住成本，才有机会赚钱。以前只想着怎么吃回本，还真没想过老板是怎么算账的。所以啊吃饭的人想着怎么吃划算，开店的人想着怎么经营才赚钱，你不是要考儿子吗？怎么反倒让儿子给你上课了？今天这猪肉还挺便宜的，比上次买的时候降了不少，那正好多买点回去，便宜是便宜了。可最近这肉卖的还没以前好呢，价格都降了，怎么反而不好卖了。可能最近买肉的人少了吧，爸爸按道理，猪肉便宜了，买的人不是应该更多吗？可能大家手里没钱了吧，想省着点花。那爸爸，你觉得附近工地开工少了，会不会也影响猪肉销量？工地开工跟猪肉有什么关系？你想啊如果一个工地原来每天有几百个工人吃饭，食堂是不是每天都要买不少肉？那肯定啊人多吃的也多。那如果工地停工了，吃饭的人少了，食堂还需要买那么多肉吗？当然不需要了。所以啊有时候不是因为猪肉降价了，大家才买的少，而是因为买肉的人变少了，价格才可能跟着下降。这么说，猪肉卖的好不好，还跟别的行业有关系。当然啦，工地开工少了，不光猪肉可能卖的少，蔬菜米面这些东西的需求也可能跟着减少，原来一个地方的变化还会影响这么多生意。对，不过猪肉价格和销量变化也不一定就是工地造成的，还可能跟供应多少季节和大家的消费习惯有关。以前我只知道东西便宜了，应该更好卖。还真没想过背后有这么多原因。所以爸爸生活里，很多事情不能只看表面，要想想他们之间有没有联系。行了，你们爷俩的经济学课先上到这儿，咱们还得回家做饭呢。看来今天这趟超市没白来，我又跟儿子学了一课，儿子妈妈也考你一个问题，妈妈，你问吧，为什么很多牛奶都是方盒子可乐，却经常用圆瓶子？这个我知道，不就是厂家觉得这样好看吗？爸爸可不只是为了好看？那你说说方形的牛奶盒摆在一起，可以贴得更紧，运输和存放的时候能更好的利用空间。可乐里面有气圆形，瓶身更容易均匀，分散，内部压力。不过包装怎么设计，还得考虑材料成本和使用方不方便，连一个瓶子的形状都有这么多讲究。当然啦，生活里很多不起眼的小东西，背后都有做生意的学问。儿子，爸爸问你个事，什么事儿？这些东西学校还没交吧。你到底从哪里学来的？就是从这套写给孩子的经济学启蒙课里面学来的。你们看，他不是光讲那些难懂的道理，而是把生活里跟钱买东西、做生意有关的知识，都用漫画故事讲出来。难怪你最近总爱问这些问题，你们看书里还讲了很多有意思的问题，比如由谁来决定价格呢？什么是需求和供题，比如如何不盲目购物？哎，这里还有一个冰淇淋的价格，为什么不一样呢？还有这个我们花的钱是从哪儿来的？以前我买东西，只知道想买就买，现在我会想这个东西到底值不值，我是不是真的需要。原来财商不只是教孩子怎么存钱，怎么赚钱，当然了，还要知道钱是怎么花出去的，商家又是怎么赚钱的。我以前总觉得你现在还小赚钱的事情，等长大了再学也不迟。其实，孩子每天都在接触钱，买零食、买玩具、逛超市，哪一样不需要花钱。是啊，与其等他长大以后自己吃亏，不如现在就让他慢慢学会判断。以后你再有什么不懂的就拿出来，咱们一起研究。爸爸不知道的，也跟你一起学。那咱们从今天开始，每天一起看两个漫画故事，好不好？好爸爸陪你妈妈也陪你。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 680,
      "end_ms": 1160,
      "text": "爸爸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1160,
      "end_ms": 4260,
      "text": "为什么同样一瓶矿泉水超市卖两块钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4540,
      "end_ms": 6060,
      "text": "高铁上却卖的更贵？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6580,
      "end_ms": 8160,
      "text": "高铁上的东西本来就贵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8359,
      "end_ms": 9400,
      "text": "有什么好奇怪的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9640,
      "end_ms": 11200,
      "text": "可明明是同样的水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11580,
      "end_ms": 13600,
      "text": "为什么换个地方就涨价了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13840,
      "end_ms": 14920,
      "text": "人家卖多少钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14920,
      "end_ms": 16040,
      "text": "你不买不就行了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 16200,
      "end_ms": 17420,
      "text": "咱们自己带水就好了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 18020,
      "end_ms": 18440,
      "text": "爸爸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 18440,
      "end_ms": 19160,
      "text": "那我问你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 19400,
      "end_ms": 23220,
      "text": "如果高铁上有好几家卖水的价格还会这么贵吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23740,
      "end_ms": 25620,
      "text": "那肯定要看他们怎么定价了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 25860,
      "end_ms": 26340,
      "text": "对呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 26820,
      "end_ms": 28140,
      "text": "如果买水不方便，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 28300,
      "end_ms": 29100,
      "text": "选择又少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 29340,
      "end_ms": 31210,
      "text": "商家就可能卖的贵一些。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 31570,
      "end_ms": 35150,
      "text": "不过还要算运输经营这些成本哟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 35730,
      "end_ms": 37870,
      "text": "你小子什么时候开始研究做生意了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 38529,
      "end_ms": 40355,
      "text": "我知道的可不止这些。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 42220,
      "end_ms": 42660,
      "text": "爸爸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 42740,
      "end_ms": 43780,
      "text": "你有没有发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 44220,
      "end_ms": 47240,
      "text": "很多商场一楼都是化妆品和珠宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 47560,
      "end_ms": 48020,
      "text": "吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 48040,
      "end_ms": 49460,
      "text": "看电影却要去楼上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 50060,
      "end_ms": 51380,
      "text": "可能是楼上环境好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 51440,
      "end_ms": 52320,
      "text": "吃饭舒服呗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 52720,
      "end_ms": 54900,
      "text": "那为什么不把餐厅放一楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 55320,
      "end_ms": 56620,
      "text": "大家进来就能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 56900,
      "end_ms": 58060,
      "text": "不是更方便吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 58760,
      "end_ms": 61400,
      "text": "商场人家自己设计的哪有那么多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 61400,
      "end_ms": 63930,
      "text": "为什么爸爸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 64190,
      "end_ms": 67495,
      "text": "你看大家进商场是不是都要经过一楼？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 67820,
      "end_ms": 68725,
      "text": "那当然了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 69180,
      "end_ms": 72425,
      "text": "那如果一楼放的是容易吸引人注意的商品，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 72810,
      "end_ms": 74490,
      "text": "就算本来没打算买的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 74790,
      "end_ms": 76875,
      "text": "路过的时候也可能进去看看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 77830,
      "end_ms": 79615,
      "text": "那餐厅为什么要放楼上呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 79980,
      "end_ms": 82505,
      "text": "因为很多人本来就是来吃饭看电影的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 82830,
      "end_ms": 84270,
      "text": "把这些店放在楼上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 84430,
      "end_ms": 85630,
      "text": "就能让人往上走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 85670,
      "end_ms": 88070,
      "text": "经过更多店铺这么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 88590,
      "end_ms": 90615,
      "text": "商场连顾客怎么走都要考虑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 90890,
      "end_ms": 91470,
      "text": "当然啦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 91670,
      "end_ms": 93650,
      "text": "做生意不光要看卖什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 93670,
      "end_ms": 95455,
      "text": "还要看东西摆在哪里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 103610,
      "end_ms": 105410,
      "text": "儿子刚才都是你在问我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 105430,
      "end_ms": 106835,
      "text": "现在爸爸考你一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 107490,
      "end_ms": 107990,
      "text": "好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 108660,
      "end_ms": 111215,
      "text": "你说这自助餐交一次钱就能随便吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 111660,
      "end_ms": 113045,
      "text": "万一客人都拼命吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 113460,
      "end_ms": 114820,
      "text": "老板不是要亏本了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 114880,
      "end_ms": 115280,
      "text": "对呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 115360,
      "end_ms": 116880,
      "text": "有些人一顿能吃好多呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 117020,
      "end_ms": 120880,
      "text": "可是爸爸你觉得每个人都能把一百块钱的东西吃回本吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 121080,
      "end_ms": 121960,
      "text": "那肯定不能。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 122080,
      "end_ms": 124215,
      "text": "所以老板看的不是某一个人吃了多少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 124510,
      "end_ms": 127455,
      "text": "而是所有客人加起来平均能吃掉多少成本。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 127690,
      "end_ms": 129610,
      "text": "你的意思是有人吃的多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 129690,
      "end_ms": 130550,
      "text": "也有人吃的少。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 130730,
      "end_ms": 130970,
      "text": "对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 131370,
      "end_ms": 133050,
      "text": "而且老板还要算食材，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 133150,
      "end_ms": 134915,
      "text": "人工、房租这些成本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 135250,
      "end_ms": 137290,
      "text": "只要整体收入能盖住成本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 137390,
      "end_ms": 138465,
      "text": "才有机会赚钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 139300,
      "end_ms": 141025,
      "text": "以前只想着怎么吃回本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 141550,
      "end_ms": 143545,
      "text": "还真没想过老板是怎么算账的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 143880,
      "end_ms": 146500,
      "text": "所以啊吃饭的人想着怎么吃划算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 146640,
      "end_ms": 148675,
      "text": "开店的人想着怎么经营才赚钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 149580,
      "end_ms": 150680,
      "text": "你不是要考儿子吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 150700,
      "end_ms": 152555,
      "text": "怎么反倒让儿子给你上课了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 159480,
      "end_ms": 160985,
      "text": "今天这猪肉还挺便宜的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 161300,
      "end_ms": 162780,
      "text": "比上次买的时候降了不少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 163120,
      "end_ms": 164705,
      "text": "那正好多买点回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 165120,
      "end_ms": 166275,
      "text": "便宜是便宜了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 166660,
      "end_ms": 168905,
      "text": "可最近这肉卖的还没以前好呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 169360,
      "end_ms": 170360,
      "text": "价格都降了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 170500,
      "end_ms": 171700,
      "text": "怎么反而不好卖了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 171820,
      "end_ms": 173745,
      "text": "可能最近买肉的人少了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 174040,
      "end_ms": 175470,
      "text": "爸爸按道理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 175470,
      "end_ms": 176170,
      "text": "猪肉便宜了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 176170,
      "end_ms": 177710,
      "text": "买的人不是应该更多吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 177910,
      "end_ms": 179270,
      "text": "可能大家手里没钱了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 179270,
      "end_ms": 180090,
      "text": "想省着点花。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 180350,
      "end_ms": 180930,
      "text": "那爸爸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 181030,
      "end_ms": 182949,
      "text": "你觉得附近工地开工少了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 182949,
      "end_ms": 184475,
      "text": "会不会也影响猪肉销量？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 184980,
      "end_ms": 186840,
      "text": "工地开工跟猪肉有什么关系？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 186960,
      "end_ms": 190520,
      "text": "你想啊如果一个工地原来每天有几百个工人吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 190820,
      "end_ms": 192840,
      "text": "食堂是不是每天都要买不少肉？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 193040,
      "end_ms": 195355,
      "text": "那肯定啊人多吃的也多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 195680,
      "end_ms": 197025,
      "text": "那如果工地停工了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 197320,
      "end_ms": 198335,
      "text": "吃饭的人少了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 198690,
      "end_ms": 200510,
      "text": "食堂还需要买那么多肉吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 200710,
      "end_ms": 201750,
      "text": "当然不需要了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 201950,
      "end_ms": 204450,
      "text": "所以啊有时候不是因为猪肉降价了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 204450,
      "end_ms": 205330,
      "text": "大家才买的少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 205590,
      "end_ms": 207410,
      "text": "而是因为买肉的人变少了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 207430,
      "end_ms": 208905,
      "text": "价格才可能跟着下降。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 209270,
      "end_ms": 209730,
      "text": "这么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 209870,
      "end_ms": 210970,
      "text": "猪肉卖的好不好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 211070,
      "end_ms": 212365,
      "text": "还跟别的行业有关系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 212550,
      "end_ms": 213085,
      "text": "当然啦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 213430,
      "end_ms": 214570,
      "text": "工地开工少了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 214590,
      "end_ms": 216025,
      "text": "不光猪肉可能卖的少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 216340,
      "end_ms": 219075,
      "text": "蔬菜米面这些东西的需求也可能跟着减少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 219530,
      "end_ms": 222410,
      "text": "原来一个地方的变化还会影响这么多生意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 222470,
      "end_ms": 222825,
      "text": "对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 223290,
      "end_ms": 226505,
      "text": "不过猪肉价格和销量变化也不一定就是工地造成的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 226770,
      "end_ms": 230165,
      "text": "还可能跟供应多少季节和大家的消费习惯有关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 230590,
      "end_ms": 232250,
      "text": "以前我只知道东西便宜了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 232250,
      "end_ms": 233095,
      "text": "应该更好卖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 233510,
      "end_ms": 235375,
      "text": "还真没想过背后有这么多原因。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 235650,
      "end_ms": 237170,
      "text": "所以爸爸生活里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 237170,
      "end_ms": 239115,
      "text": "很多事情不能只看表面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 239480,
      "end_ms": 241675,
      "text": "要想想他们之间有没有联系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 242240,
      "end_ms": 242660,
      "text": "行了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00119",
      "start_ms": 242800,
      "end_ms": 244875,
      "text": "你们爷俩的经济学课先上到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00120",
      "start_ms": 245070,
      "end_ms": 246365,
      "text": "咱们还得回家做饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00121",
      "start_ms": 246810,
      "end_ms": 248815,
      "text": "看来今天这趟超市没白来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00122",
      "start_ms": 249180,
      "end_ms": 250595,
      "text": "我又跟儿子学了一课，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00123",
      "start_ms": 259760,
      "end_ms": 261855,
      "text": "儿子妈妈也考你一个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00124",
      "start_ms": 262230,
      "end_ms": 262650,
      "text": "妈妈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00125",
      "start_ms": 262650,
      "end_ms": 263325,
      "text": "你问吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00126",
      "start_ms": 263650,
      "end_ms": 266130,
      "text": "为什么很多牛奶都是方盒子可乐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00127",
      "start_ms": 266130,
      "end_ms": 267345,
      "text": "却经常用圆瓶子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00128",
      "start_ms": 267600,
      "end_ms": 268340,
      "text": "这个我知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00129",
      "start_ms": 268400,
      "end_ms": 270060,
      "text": "不就是厂家觉得这样好看吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00130",
      "start_ms": 270140,
      "end_ms": 271660,
      "text": "爸爸可不只是为了好看？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00131",
      "start_ms": 271840,
      "end_ms": 274420,
      "text": "那你说说方形的牛奶盒摆在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00132",
      "start_ms": 274420,
      "end_ms": 275385,
      "text": "可以贴得更紧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00133",
      "start_ms": 275680,
      "end_ms": 278085,
      "text": "运输和存放的时候能更好的利用空间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00134",
      "start_ms": 278480,
      "end_ms": 280180,
      "text": "可乐里面有气圆形，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00135",
      "start_ms": 280180,
      "end_ms": 281420,
      "text": "瓶身更容易均匀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00136",
      "start_ms": 281420,
      "end_ms": 281780,
      "text": "分散，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00137",
      "start_ms": 281780,
      "end_ms": 282545,
      "text": "内部压力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00138",
      "start_ms": 283010,
      "end_ms": 284325,
      "text": "不过包装怎么设计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00139",
      "start_ms": 284540,
      "end_ms": 287500,
      "text": "还得考虑材料成本和使用方不方便，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00140",
      "start_ms": 287660,
      "end_ms": 290040,
      "text": "连一个瓶子的形状都有这么多讲究。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00141",
      "start_ms": 290300,
      "end_ms": 290935,
      "text": "当然啦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00142",
      "start_ms": 291380,
      "end_ms": 293200,
      "text": "生活里很多不起眼的小东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00143",
      "start_ms": 293360,
      "end_ms": 294975,
      "text": "背后都有做生意的学问。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00144",
      "start_ms": 295790,
      "end_ms": 296205,
      "text": "儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00145",
      "start_ms": 296390,
      "end_ms": 297095,
      "text": "爸爸问你个事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00146",
      "start_ms": 297820,
      "end_ms": 298505,
      "text": "什么事儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00147",
      "start_ms": 298950,
      "end_ms": 300465,
      "text": "这些东西学校还没交吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00148",
      "start_ms": 301220,
      "end_ms": 302515,
      "text": "你到底从哪里学来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00149",
      "start_ms": 314380,
      "end_ms": 318140,
      "text": "就是从这套写给孩子的经济学启蒙课里面学来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00150",
      "start_ms": 319700,
      "end_ms": 320240,
      "text": "你们看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00151",
      "start_ms": 320460,
      "end_ms": 322640,
      "text": "他不是光讲那些难懂的道理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00152",
      "start_ms": 322860,
      "end_ms": 326880,
      "text": "而是把生活里跟钱买东西、做生意有关的知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00153",
      "start_ms": 327160,
      "end_ms": 328800,
      "text": "都用漫画故事讲出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00154",
      "start_ms": 329580,
      "end_ms": 331720,
      "text": "难怪你最近总爱问这些问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00155",
      "start_ms": 331920,
      "end_ms": 334840,
      "text": "你们看书里还讲了很多有意思的问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00156",
      "start_ms": 335260,
      "end_ms": 337460,
      "text": "比如由谁来决定价格呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00157",
      "start_ms": 337640,
      "end_ms": 339140,
      "text": "什么是需求和供题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00158",
      "start_ms": 339380,
      "end_ms": 341240,
      "text": "比如如何不盲目购物？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00159",
      "start_ms": 341440,
      "end_ms": 341680,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00160",
      "start_ms": 341700,
      "end_ms": 343725,
      "text": "这里还有一个冰淇淋的价格，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00161",
      "start_ms": 343910,
      "end_ms": 344910,
      "text": "为什么不一样呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00162",
      "start_ms": 344990,
      "end_ms": 347730,
      "text": "还有这个我们花的钱是从哪儿来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00163",
      "start_ms": 347930,
      "end_ms": 349090,
      "text": "以前我买东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00164",
      "start_ms": 349270,
      "end_ms": 350590,
      "text": "只知道想买就买，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00165",
      "start_ms": 351010,
      "end_ms": 353410,
      "text": "现在我会想这个东西到底值不值，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00166",
      "start_ms": 353510,
      "end_ms": 354590,
      "text": "我是不是真的需要。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00167",
      "start_ms": 354770,
      "end_ms": 356990,
      "text": "原来财商不只是教孩子怎么存钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00168",
      "start_ms": 357070,
      "end_ms": 357710,
      "text": "怎么赚钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00169",
      "start_ms": 357990,
      "end_ms": 358590,
      "text": "当然了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00170",
      "start_ms": 358710,
      "end_ms": 360630,
      "text": "还要知道钱是怎么花出去的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00171",
      "start_ms": 360730,
      "end_ms": 362185,
      "text": "商家又是怎么赚钱的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00172",
      "start_ms": 362560,
      "end_ms": 365570,
      "text": "我以前总觉得你现在还小赚钱的事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00173",
      "start_ms": 365590,
      "end_ms": 367085,
      "text": "等长大了再学也不迟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00174",
      "start_ms": 367510,
      "end_ms": 367790,
      "text": "其实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00175",
      "start_ms": 367790,
      "end_ms": 369250,
      "text": "孩子每天都在接触钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00176",
      "start_ms": 369450,
      "end_ms": 371390,
      "text": "买零食、买玩具、逛超市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00177",
      "start_ms": 371610,
      "end_ms": 372810,
      "text": "哪一样不需要花钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00178",
      "start_ms": 372950,
      "end_ms": 373495,
      "text": "是啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00179",
      "start_ms": 373940,
      "end_ms": 375840,
      "text": "与其等他长大以后自己吃亏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00180",
      "start_ms": 375980,
      "end_ms": 378165,
      "text": "不如现在就让他慢慢学会判断。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00181",
      "start_ms": 378600,
      "end_ms": 380700,
      "text": "以后你再有什么不懂的就拿出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00182",
      "start_ms": 380700,
      "end_ms": 381665,
      "text": "咱们一起研究。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00183",
      "start_ms": 381990,
      "end_ms": 382890,
      "text": "爸爸不知道的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00184",
      "start_ms": 382890,
      "end_ms": 383855,
      "text": "也跟你一起学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00185",
      "start_ms": 384160,
      "end_ms": 385560,
      "text": "那咱们从今天开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00186",
      "start_ms": 385720,
      "end_ms": 387420,
      "text": "每天一起看两个漫画故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00187",
      "start_ms": 387420,
      "end_ms": 387900,
      "text": "好不好？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_31eededcad0ac57f_s00188",
      "start_ms": 388020,
      "end_ms": 390395,
      "text": "好爸爸陪你妈妈也陪你。"
    }
  ],
